{"repositoryId":1404896887,"availability":"available","full":"omarqaterge/hermes-mobile-app","name":"hermes-mobile-app","description":"Your agent, on your phone. A native Android app for Hermes Agent, running entirely on-device (Termux).","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":70,"forks":12,"created":"2026-10-04T22:51:20Z","updated":"2026-10-15T14:55:01Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["ai-agent","android","hermes-agent","llm","termux"],"demo":"https://x.com/markkeeper2/status/2106873833978540280","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:36.421Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:36.421Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:36.421Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T15:00:36.421Z","stars":70,"forks":12}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A native-feeling Android app for Hermes Agent, running entirely on your phone.","Unofficial community project. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Nous Research.","Hermes Agent is a powerful agent, but it lives in a terminal. Hermes Mobile gives it a proper phone interface: streaming chat, live tool cards, approvals you can answer from the status bar, a canvas for building things together, and notifications that work while the app is closed. Hermes runs in Termux on the same phone, so the whole thing is self-contained."],"features":["Approvals and questions show up on the status chip (an Android 16 Live Update; older versions get a normal notification). One tap on the chip, pick an answer, done. The app does not need to be open.","KaTeX equations, sortable tables with \"Copy table\", tick-able task lists, Obsidian-style callouts, Mermaid diagrams (full screen, pinch to zoom), coloured diffs, long code that collapses, inline SVG and HTML cards.","Ask for an interactive page or a 3D scene and Hermes builds it live in a document beside the chat. HTML runs in a sandbox that is offline unless you allow it. Every change is a version with a diff you can restore.","Pick Hermes under Default apps → Digital assistant app and long-pressing the power button (or the assist gesture) opens it straight in hands-free Live mode. Settings → Voice shows whether it is on.","Search inside every message, pin, archive, link chats to chats. Every memory write is shown as a diff, and there is a screen to see what Hermes remembers. Dark, OLED black or light."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/omarqaterge/hermes-mobile-app/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"31a11d7ee1a721fd27e3850b74c53d75df748f2712e9640f37c73c983273d506","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:36.568Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:36.568Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A native-feeling Android app for Hermes Agent, running entirely on your phone.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/omarqaterge/hermes-mobile-app/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You sign in from the app.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/omarqaterge/hermes-mobile-app/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The app opens on Connect Hermes to a model: sign in with your subscription or paste an API key, then pick the model new","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/omarqaterge/hermes-mobile-app/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"The app opens on Connect Hermes to a model: sign in with your subscription or paste an API key, then pick the model new","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/omarqaterge/hermes-mobile-app/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The app opens on Connect Hermes to a model: sign in with your subscription or paste an API key, then pick the model new","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/omarqaterge/hermes-mobile-app/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"31a11d7ee1a721fd27e3850b74c53d75df748f2712e9640f37c73c983273d506","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/omarqaterge/hermes-mobile-app/blob/main/README.m